fleet propose --instant <value> --milestone <value> --status <value> --evidence <value>
    the WORKER's status proposal; never a roadmap write
    --instant <value>            (required) the PROPOSING instant — its id is what attributes the proposal
    --to <value>                 the instant holding the roadmap to propose INTO; defaults to --instant
    --milestone <value>          (required) the milestone id
    --status <value>             (required) blocked|ready|running|awaiting-ci|done|dropped
    --evidence <value>           (required) an evidence path; repeatable, and at least one is required
    --home <value>               the record/pool store root; overrides $FLEET_HOME
    --instants-dir <value>       where instants live; overrides $FLEET_INSTANTS
    --porcelain                  machine form on stdout: tab-separated, no banner (NFR2-7)
    --help                       print this verb's derived usage and exit 0
    --dry-run                    evaluate every gate and CREATE NOTHING; the delta is asserted to be zero

exit codes:
    0  ok
    1  needs attention / check failed
    2  bad input
    3  no capacity
    4  refused by an admission rule
    pane-guard only (FD-10):
    0  safe
    10 queued-text
    11 mid-turn
    12 not-claude
    13 unknown-pane

